    "durationMs": 75262,
    "humanMessages": [
      {
        "roomId": "room_826fd131-a964-4b80-8d9c-49783e3bf42b",
        "body": "@e2e-codex-0929-5b1c486eb233666ae06f965d @e2e-claude-sonnet-221c48679b1594730ba16368 服务已重启。请继续上次的讨论：不要重新读取文件，各用一两句话复述你在重启前给出的结论，并指出对方结论中你同意或不同意的一点。",
        "attemptedAt": "2026-09-29T08:46:06.059Z",
        "messageId": "message_0c7aca4e-37bf-4810-852b-26c8fc48fc09",
        "roomSeq": 113,
        "createdAt": "2026-09-29T08:46:06.090Z",
        "deduplicated": false,
        "roomLabel": "频道"
      }
    ],
    "replies": [
      {
        "messageId": "message_6d75441c-e3a4-44ab-af1b-107b235ea97e",
        "roomId": "room_826fd131-a964-4b80-8d9c-49783e3bf42b",
        "actorId": "principal_a30377e2-f9bf-4e09-8f2b-5d12ce481101",
        "threadId": null,
        "body": "复述我的结论（测试覆盖审查）：主路径与 fail-closed 分支覆盖充分——PID 不匹配、缺失/非法 mode、原子写入 0600 与 round-trip、非法网络集拒绝均有测；缺口在 writeLaunchReceipt 非正整数 PID、schemaVersion≠1（如版本 2）、损坏 JSON rethrow、以及临时文件清理失败这四条边界路径。\n\n对 @e2e-codex-0929-5b1c486eb233666ae06f965d 的结论，我同意的一点：restartNetworkEnvironment 不独立校验 incumbentPid 的类型与存活性，正确性依赖调用方传入可信 PID——这与我的\"写入 PID 校验无测试\"缺口互补，共同刻画了 PID 信任链的边界。",
        "createdAt": "2026-09-29T08:46:21.184Z",
        "roomSeq": 122,
        "activationId": "activation_46937896-a3d4-4bf0-814b-c723b846532e",
        "recipientIds": ["principal_210262c9-9fa2-487d-b7c8-b2d2c5d36dca"],
        "label": "claude",
        "roomLabel": "频道",
        "latencyMs": 15094
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message_891b3ecd-e60b-48c5-a96b-cbe9b1f44ee5",
        "roomId": "room_826fd131-a964-4b80-8d9c-49783e3bf42b",
        "actorId": "principal_210262c9-9fa2-487d-b7c8-b2d2c5d36dca",
        "threadId": null,
        "body": "我的结论是 receipt 写入用随机临时文件以 `wx`/0600 创建后 rename，并校验写入 PID 为正整数；重启只核对 receipt PID 与 incumbentPid 相等（workbench-launch-receipt.mjs L111–124、87–99）。我同意 @e2e-claude-sonnet-221c48679b1594730ba16368 指出的非法写入 PID 缺少测试；这与 incumbentPid 依赖调用方担保的实现边界互补。",
        "createdAt": "2026-09-29T08:46:41.547Z",
        "roomSeq": 126,
        "activationId": "activation_b5fbcc49-2374-4d8a-b7be-b918ab13cc73",
